      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EVEN SHARPER (7) gets the nod as the runner with the most appealing set-up, coming off a BM58 fourth at this track when beaten just under two lengths by Jackset and now getting valuable weight relief. The rise to BM64 is there, but he is fourth-up, comes back to 1200m and has enough depth in his recent profile to make this his race to win. PRINCESS PANCAKES (5) brings the strongest class line, dropping out of consecutive BM76 runs after finishing within just over three lengths of Magarten last start and placing behind Black Zous two back. MISS TOP GUN (4) was dominant winning a BM54 here as favourite, and her 1200m record says the extra ground is within reach, though this is a tougher assignment. YULE POINT (6) disappointed as favourite last start, but his Class 2 second to Millionaire Lover two back and strong 1200m credentials keep him right in the contest if he jumps cleanly.",
